OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly showers clearing east
OL,6,Fcoast, then a cloudy but mostly dry
OL,7,Fmorning. Some showery rain spreads
OL,8,Feast in the afternoon. Strong
OL,9,Fsoutherly winds with a chance of
OL,10,Fcoastal gales, winds easing somewhat
OL,11,Fin the afternoon. Warmer.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy evening with
OL,14,Fsome showers. Then turning drier
OL,15,Fovernight with some clear intervals,
OL,16,Fjust the odd shower in the Northwest.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FA dry bright start then cloud
OL,19,Fand showers spreading from the west,
OL,20,Fsome heavy. Brightening up again later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
